description: Generate high-converting, single-file HTML funnel pages in a Neo-Brutalist aesthetic. Raw concrete architecture meets digital product marketing — hard borders, oversized type, flat color blocks, zero softness. Output is always a standalone .html file with 8+ sections. Trigger when someone describes a product or business and asks for a landing page, funnel, or site with a bold, raw, or brutalist visual direction.
