- [ ] All 8+ required sections present and in order
- [ ] Hero min-height 85vh, display type ≥ 6rem, `font-weight: 900`
- [ ] Ghost numerals aria-hidden, pointer-events none
- [ ] Slash accent `///` present in nav/logo
- [ ] Inversion section (black bg) appears exactly once
- [ ] CTA button: `border-radius: 0`, `transition: none`, hover inverts bg/text
- [ ] Footer top border is visibly heavier than all other borders
- [ ] No two adjacent hue fills
- [ ] All hue-fill backgrounds use ink text (not white) — verify contrast
- [ ] White-text-on-black (inversion panels) only
- [ ] FAQ accordion functional with JS
- [ ] Single `.html` file, no external CSS files
- [ ] Mobile stacking verified for hero and feature grid
- [ ] WCAG AA contrast on terra (#DD614C) with ink text — borderline, must verify
- [ ] Focus rings present on all interactive elements "
